<p><strong>Archeology&nbsp;(July&nbsp;9&nbsp;</strong>and<strong>&nbsp;August&nbsp;5)</strong>&nbsp;<br>Dig into archeology! Learn about the Billings family and&nbsp;identify&nbsp;the artefacts you find.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Geology&nbsp;(July&nbsp;16&nbsp;</strong>and<strong>&nbsp;August 12)</strong>&nbsp;<br>Unearth the secrets of our natural history and&nbsp;identify&nbsp;geological samples.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Paleontology&nbsp;(July&nbsp;23&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>August&nbsp;19)</strong>&nbsp;<br>Discover the world of plant and animal fossils.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Beyond the&nbsp;Pit&nbsp;(July&nbsp;30</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>August&nbsp;26)</strong>&nbsp;<br>Tell the story of your excavation! Piece together your discoveries and curate a museum exhibition.&nbsp;</p>
