<h3>Picnic on the museum grounds</h3>
<p>Visitors are welcome to bring their own snacks&nbsp;and picnic on the museum grounds. To preserve the artefacts in the museum, no eating or drinking is permitted in the exhibition spaces. Outside food is also not permitted in the tent where Tea on the Lawn is served.</p></div>
      
